\s1 Principles of Marriage
\p \v 1 \w Now|strong="G01161"\w* \w for|strong="G04012"\w* \w the matters|strong="G03739"\w* \w you wrote about|strong="G01125"\w*: \w It is good|strong="G02570"\w* \w to abstain from sexual relations|strong="G00680"\w*.\f + \fr 7:1 \ft Literally \fqa It is good for a man not to touch a woman.\f* \v 2 \w But|strong="G01161"\w* \w because|strong="G01223"\w* \w there is so much|strong="G03588"\w* \w sexual immorality|strong="G04202"\w*, \w each man|strong="G01538"\w* \w should have|strong="G02192"\w* \w his|strong="G01438"\w* \w own|strong="G03588"\w* \w wife|strong="G01135"\w*, \w and|strong="G02532"\w* \w each woman|strong="G01538"\w* \w her|strong="G03588"\w* \w own|strong="G02398"\w* \w husband|strong="G00435"\w*.
