\p \v 19 \w The|strong="G03588"\w* \w churches|strong="G01577"\w* \w in the province of Asia|strong="G00773"\w*\f + \fr 16:19 \ft Literally \fqa in Asia\ft ; Asia was a Roman province in what is now western Turkey. \f* \w send you greetings|strong="G00782"\w*.
\p \w Aquila|strong="G00207"\w* \w and|strong="G02532"\w* \w Prisca|strong="G04251"\w*\f + \fr 16:19 \fqa Prisca \ft is a variant of \fqa Priscilla\ft ; see Acts 18:2.\f* \w greet|strong="G00782"\w* \w you|strong="G04771"\w* \w warmly|strong="G04183"\w* \w in|strong="G01722"\w* \w the Lord|strong="G02962"\w*, \w and so does|strong="G04862"\w* \w the|strong="G03588"\w* \w church|strong="G01577"\w* \w that meets at|strong="G02596"\w* \w their|strong="G00846"\w* \w house|strong="G03624"\w*.
